  "title": "Grant's Famous Midnight Grill BBQ Sauce",
  "description": "For this amazing sauce, you'll need a bottle of prepared barbecue sauce, some Scotch whiskey, and a slew of spices: hot pepper sauce, cayenne, chili powder, crushed red pepper flakes, onion powder and more.",
  "authors": [
    "Grant Mosesian"
